-- Conformance: an effect operation performed where the row in force does
-- not name its effect is a checker error (Chapter 7, Section 7.4).
-- Tests: E125 — an operation is held to the effect row in force as a call
-- to a function is (Section 7.8), so `Random.random_int` in a function
-- whose row names only `IO` is refused at the call (#1702).
public fn roll(@Unit -> @Int)
  requires(true)
  ensures(true)
  effects(<IO>)
{
  Random.random_int(1, 6)
}
